T: The Spinning Dogs of Carrowkennedy
C: Damian Caisley
Z: Cameron Cross
N: Inspired by the sight of two "absolutely mental" dogs spinning around each other in Carrowkennedy.
N: It has a fun "bridge" part you can surprise your friends with.  Recommended order is to play through the
N: regular tune {A-B} twice, then on the third time through include the bridge and finish on {B}.
